        // If call did not revert then:
        //  - recorded balance did not decrease (already-covered rule avoided but included as part of relation with balances)
        //  - recorded unlockTime is at least beforeUnlock and also at least block.timestamp (i.e. not set to a past time)
        //  - contract's ETH balance increased by at least the increase in recorded balance
        assert(
            reverted || (
                afterBalance >= beforeBalance
                && afterUnlock >= beforeUnlock
                && afterUnlock >= block.timestamp
